Karlach is in dire need of some TLC from our favourite wizard

Hidden away where debauchery thrives and morphs: they become one of the same, if in spirit alone: here: they become fiends, mere beasts taken over by their compulsive ache for gratification and destruction;
  In this perfumed room, they are monstrosities of the purest sorts.
How sweet it is to bask in the ruins of ambition.
